    {
      "target": "Strings/StringsFromCSFiles",
      "key": "Fishing_Channel_Intro",
      "english": "Thank you for tuning in to F.I.B.S., the Fishing Information Broadcast Service. Despite our unfortunate name, you can rest assured that we provide only the most trustworthy information about this season's fishing opportunities.",
